rowse to it on a mobile device\n5. hit the \"fullscreen\" button\n6. try to edit the lineedit text\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[virtual-keyboard-fullscreen.tar.gz](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25888181/virtual-keyboard-fullscreen.tar.gz)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117342/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117342/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}